[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i37"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……找不到啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"平时，我只会漫无目的地走在这条路上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而今天，我走在这里是为了寻找识。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“希望她不会又饿到晕了过去……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"手里拿着包着饭团的包裹。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"出门前，我拜托羽未做了饭团。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我跟她说要做便当时，她果不其然就想把炒饭团成团，于是我请她做成了白米饭团。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"等找到识以后，就把这个给她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“去别的地方找找看吧。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i416"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i465"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i444"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i413"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i51"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……还是找不到啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"平时的话，基本都能在一些地方碰到她的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是去了别的地方吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……我为什么要做到这种地步呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"连我都对自己的行为感到疑惑。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，从昨天开始就一直有点在意识。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当然，这种在意是属于一种担心。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是不能放着说自己失忆的识不管而已。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"称不上是什么正义感或者使命感。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"打个比方的话，就像是收留走丢的小狗……那样的心情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“要说哪里还没去过的话……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不经意间看向山的方向。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她该不会还在那里吧……”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i11"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……找到了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"果然，识在神社里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"准确地说，是在神社境内睡着了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“居然在境内睡觉，她以为自己是神明吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在鸟居前行了一礼，进入了境内。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喂，识。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“呼～……呼～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喂……你没事吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“该不会又饿晕过去了吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“识。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她醒了过来。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12500"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“呀……这不是羽依里嘛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呀什么呀啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12484"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯嗯……哈啊啊啊……啊呼……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她起身打了个哈欠，使劲伸了个懒腰。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“一点都不知道别人的心情……真是有够悠闲的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12463"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯？什么心情？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……没什么。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“话说回来，你饿不饿？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12490"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“还好吧，没有那么饿。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12449"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“昨天吃了很多山菜呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“山菜？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12559"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这里是个好地方啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12556"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“有手水舍可以喝水，然后因为是在山里，所以也有很多山菜。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12562"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“还有一座社殿，下雨的时候也能躲雨哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等等。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12569"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯？怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你该不会从昨天开始一直都在这里吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12449"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“没错。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看着识那副得意的样子，一个令人不安的想法掠过脑海。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一个难以置信的可能性。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我们在这座岛上相遇，已经过去了十来天吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12490"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“是啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这段时间里……你是在哪过夜的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这个季节的话，睡在外面也完全没问题的嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12463"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……不不不。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不不不不，虽然觉得不太可能……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这家伙，居然一直都在露宿……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12484"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“先不说这个了，羽依里，我刚才就很在意了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“你手里拿的是御结饭团吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12498"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“虽然知道这么问很失礼，但可以分我一点吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不行……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12472"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“呜哎……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“过这种生活是不行的！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“识，你过来一下！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12466"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“突、突然间怎么了？你想对我做什么؟!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“有点吓人啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“别管了。只要跟我来，想要什么饭团都给你！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12478"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“呜哎？呜哎哎哎哎～～!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我强行拽着她的手从神社走下来，朝加藤家走去。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i58"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我回来了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“镜子阿姨在吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“欢迎回来，羽依里。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11578"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“咦……这孩子是？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这家伙是――”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12571"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“被、被他强行……带过来的……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12577"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“说只要跟过来就给我好吃的……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11566"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喂，说话注意点。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11563"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“……我得给姐姐打个电话了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等一下！我会好好解释的！”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就是说，这家伙一直都在外面露宿。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11563"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“哎呀哎呀……真是真是。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12608"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“所以我不是都说没问题了吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“才不会没问题。要是出事了怎么办？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12602"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“喂喂，你应该知道我的体能有多强吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不就是跑得快而已吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12605"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“别看我这样，其实也学过一两门武术哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦……14岁啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12478"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“呜哎!؟为什么突然用这么温柔的眼神！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“小识。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12463"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“什么事？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11546"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“这样不行。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“哎？可是这个岛上不都是好人吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11584"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“这样不行。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“现在是夏天，也不会感冒的哦？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11546"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“这样不行。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12501"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“而且也找到了神社，有屋顶……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11584"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“这样不行。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12472"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“呜哎……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这就是所谓大人的应对方式啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"长见识了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，对了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11578"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12463"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“镜子阿姨，我想让识去洗个澡。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“露宿的话应该意味着……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12537"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“我每天都有好好淋水的！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“小识。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12466"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“呜哎……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11546"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“这样不行。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12472"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“好、好的……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“我这就去烧水，稍等一下哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12501"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“……谢、谢谢……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子阿姨去烧洗澡水，走出了起居室。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12460"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“她该不会……是鬼吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“别说这么失礼的话。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12484"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“可是你看那压迫感……一副皮笑肉不笑的感觉啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好吧，我也是第一次见镜子阿姨这个样子。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过那是因为镜子阿姨是好人。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12463"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“什么意思？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就是说她是真心在担心你。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12490"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“原来如此。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12449"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“确实是个好人呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“那么，羽依里呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12463"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“你为什么会想要照顾我呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎呀，女孩子天天露宿什么的，是个人都会在意的吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“而且咱们都认识一段时间了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不可能放着你不管啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12498"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“……羽依里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12501"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“现在，我对你有点心动了，该怎么办？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12498"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等一下。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“毕竟我上的是男校，就算你比我小，被女孩子这么说的话……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12484"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“不过，我完全没打算和任何人发展成亲密关系。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12475"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“所以，请别往心里去。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12490"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“你一定能找到一个好人的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么感觉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就好像我被甩了一样？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12498"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“毕竟都说初恋注定是无法圆满的呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可以不要随便给我制造初恋吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11548"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“小识――洗澡水烧好了哦――”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12559"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“好――”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12556"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“那么，我就借用一下浴室了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“快去洗吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真是的，早熟的孩子啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“自己说完心动又反悔……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？心动了？对我？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽说她年纪比我小，但感觉也蛮不错的。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“羽依里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，镜子阿姨。谢谢你给她用浴室。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11546"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“不，没什么。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11578"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“话说回来，你和那孩子是什么关系？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……那个，应该就是普通朋友吧……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是我在岛上闲逛时遇到的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“之后偶尔碰到过几次，就聊聊天，给她弄点吃的东西，差不多就是这样的关系。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不上不下，仅此而已。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11566"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“真的只是这样？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还一起玩过捉鬼游戏。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11578"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“捉鬼游戏？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她自称是‘鬼’来着。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11563"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“鬼？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是的，虽然只是自称。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11566"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“……啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子阿姨露出了恍然大悟的表情，或许是猜到了我想说什么。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11622"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“是青春期啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也算是每个人的必经之路。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11595"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“……我可以理解。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“您能理解啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们之间不需要更多的言语。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11635"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两人隔着墙壁，用温柔的目光注视着浴室的方向。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对了，镜子阿姨。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这座岛上有什么关于鬼的故事吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11578"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“鬼的故事？像民间传说那样的？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对，就像是鬼的传说啊，口耳相传的故事之类的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11552"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“唔，好像没怎么听说过呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识一直都在跟岛上的人打听鬼的故事，但到目前为止，还没有证实过确实有鬼的存在。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"果然岛上并不存在这样的传说吧。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11578"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“怎么突然问起鬼的事了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“识似乎在寻找这些。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“找这座岛上流传的鬼的传说。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11566"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“自称‘鬼’的孩子，在寻找鬼的传说？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“大概正是因为这样，她才会自称‘鬼’的吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11571"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“哦……想要亲自成为自己憧憬的对象那样……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11546"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“我理解。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我理解。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两人一起点了点头。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“不过，为了寻找鬼的传说在外面露宿十多天，她还真是了不起呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“顺便说一下，她好像还失忆了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11566"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子露出了目瞪口呆的表情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“镜子阿姨？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11571"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“你突然说了很不得了的事呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也是突然听说的，当时很吃惊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11563"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“她这样……没问题吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“据她自己说，这没什么大不了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11554"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“我觉得这可是天大的事情啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也这么觉得。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但她自己说没问题。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11571"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“……现在的孩子真是了不起啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她现在记得的只有神山识这个名字，以及要在这座岛上寻找鬼的传说这件事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“顺便问一下，岛上有姓神山的人吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11552"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“很可惜，这座岛上没有姓神山的人。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是这样啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"本以为姓氏可能会成为什么线索，但看来是行不通了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“不过听你这么一说，就感觉更不能放着她不管了呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“既然是这样的话，在她达成目标之前就让她住在这里吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可以吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11546"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“我是没关系的啦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11552"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“倒不如说让她一个人在外面才更让人担心。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也是这么想的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“我想羽未应该也会同意的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“希望如此吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11614"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“要说有什么问题的话，那就是客房已经用来给你住了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11602"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“也不能让小识睡在走廊上吧……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道……这是要我和她同床共枕？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“羽依里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是、是的！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11584"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“从今天开始，你可以睡在起居室吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………遵命。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我被赶出了自己的房间。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12983"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“呼――泡得真舒服啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12984"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子回仓库后不久，识就洗好了澡回到了起居室。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我不禁被识的模样吸引住了视线。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她身上穿着跟白羽和苍一样的校服。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你为什么穿这身衣服？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12982"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“是镜子阿姨让我换上这件衣服的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13000"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“好像是放在仓库里的东西，说穿这身衣服在岛上行动会比较方便。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来如此。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13001"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“话说回来，这是什么衣服？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12985"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“摸起来滑溜溜的，而且还很轻便，活动起来很舒服。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这是一件校服。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“确实，穿这身衣服在岛上调查会很方便吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13001"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“是这样吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“首先，不会引起别人的怀疑。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13053"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“……难道我之前很可疑吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“一个穿着和服自称‘鬼’的人在到处打听鬼的传说，确实有点太扎眼了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13055"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯，确实感觉有些人是在提防着我呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过，因为这身校服大家都很熟悉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“岛上的人可能会因此更加放心，就更愿意跟你说话了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13044"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“原来如此。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还有，如果你遇到了同龄人，这样叫他会特别有效。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“前辈。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13001"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“前辈？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为你跟岛上那些人穿着同一个学校的校服嘛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“他们会觉得是后辈在寻求帮助，估计会非常愿意帮忙的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毕竟不管怎么说，这里的人都挺热心的。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13000"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯……虽然不太明白，但可以作为参考。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12985"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识直勾勾地盯着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12978"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“前辈。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"滋滋滋――!!"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好像有什么东西――……贯穿了我的全身。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13001"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“羽依里？你这是怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，没什么。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"让自己保持冷静。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13000"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“是吗？那就好……羽依里……不，前辈？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"滋滋滋――!!"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12987"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“你那张不自然的扑克脸很吓人的哦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没事，只是稍微把控一下表情而已。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13002"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这可不能说是没事啊，前辈。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"滋滋滋――!!"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊哈啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再也忍不下去了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12987"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“羽依里!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不对！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13001"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“称呼……！不是这样叫的吧！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13003"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“啊，哦，抱歉，前辈。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咣当――!!"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……啊啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的天啊……明明是我自己提议的……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没想到威力居然会这么大。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对于在男校上学的我来说，这种被年龄小的女孩子叫“前辈”的场景，简直是极具杀伤力的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一度离我远去的青春，此时此刻又回来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“再说一次……拜托了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12985"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“……前辈？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃啊!؟”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":477,"value":["==",["v",6003],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":362,"target":2},{"op":"goto","target":682},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":480,"value":["==",["v",6003],2]},{"op":"callScene","scene":361,"target":2},{"op":"goto","target":682},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15386"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“再来一次。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12978"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“前辈。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15386"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“再来一次！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12985"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“那个……羽依里？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不要叫这个，叫前辈！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13003"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“不是……有人回来了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15387"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？……啊，羽未……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15405"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个……欢迎回来？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15403"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……前辈和变态，听起来还真像呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“别随便押韵啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13001"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“羽依里，这位是？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……是我的亲戚羽未。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15387"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“变态可没有什么亲戚。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"被干脆利落地否认了。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15499"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“初次见面，我是羽未。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13026"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“我是神山识。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15468"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“咦？你是……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13037"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯？啊，你是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你们认识？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13039"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“之前在山上的空地见过。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15455"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没想到她们两个之前碰过面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，识和羽未好像都经常在岛上到处转悠来着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在什么地方遇到过也很正常。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“识从今天起要在我们家里借住了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12985"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“咦，是这样吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15350"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“为什么当事人自己都不知道啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“刚才我和镜子阿姨商量之后决定的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说是不能就这样把她丢在外面，所以在她达成目的之前就让她住在这里。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“她的目的是什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“识是来岛上寻找过去存在过的鬼的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“而我实际上就是鬼哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她得意洋洋地挺起胸膛说道。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15337"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“鬼……吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她有点怪怪的啦。不过她现在14岁，你懂的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15357"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“比变态要健全多了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……好刻薄。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12999"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“不过，既然要承蒙各位照顾，那就得付住宿费才行呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13000"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“说到食宿之恩，那可是要以人生相报的大恩情啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你还是多珍惜下自己的人生吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12993"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“别太在意字面意思，主要领会一下我的心意。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“所以呢，我可以帮你们实现一个愿望。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“来了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15357"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“什么愿望都可以吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12978"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“什么都行哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15340"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“这么说的话，要是鹰原哥提出奇怪的要求该怎么办？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13001"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15328"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“比如像刚才的变态行为那样的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不、不是，那个是――”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12987"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“等等，刚才那个是变态行为吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识以一副难以置信般的眼神看着我。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15375"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“神山姐姐还是多爱惜一下自己吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“而且，这座岛上的人不会要求回报的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13003"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“啊……好的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15458"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那么，我得去准备晚饭了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15455"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未微微鞠了一躬后走去了厨房。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12985"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“她是个很可靠的孩子呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12998"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“她真的是你的亲戚吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊……”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i63"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，到了晚饭时间。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“请用餐吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11584"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“小识，你要多吃一点哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12982"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“好的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她面对着海鲜炒饭正坐了下来，双手合十。"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12978"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“我开始吃了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“哎呀，真讲礼仪呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12984"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“对面前的食物表示感谢是理所当然的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i13000"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“对做了这份食物的人，以及对这份恩赐本身表示感谢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也学着她双手合十。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我开始吃了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我还是第一次看鹰原哥这么做呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也一直都很感谢羽未的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15340"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“请不要说这种假惺惺的话。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12978"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“啊呜！嗯嗯……咕咚。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12982"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“好吃！非常好吃啊，羽未！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15445"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“谢、谢谢夸奖。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15412"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“你吃得这么开心，我也很高兴。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊呜……嚼嚼……咕噜。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，真好吃！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未做的炒饭，从来都是最棒的！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15328"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“抱歉，刚才说得太刻意了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13000"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“羽依里，你平时都吃这样的美食吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……是啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12978"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“真让人羡慕啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15572"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“也算不上美食啦，太夸张了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12982"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“不会啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12984"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“对我来说，这就是最棒的美食！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15573"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11546"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“太好了呢，羽未。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15576"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“谢、谢谢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未被一通大夸特夸，脸颊微微泛红了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这招对羽未还真是致命啊。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13000"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“说起来，我想商量一件事。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15325"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“要再来一碗吗？还有很多哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12982"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这道菜，我可以称之为用油和高汤炒制的，加满海鲜不需要捏制的御结饭团吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15378"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11566"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“你说什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12984"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“或者说，如果有机会的话，希望你可以把这道菜捏一下。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12978"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“我很想尝尝它做成御结饭团是什么味道。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15353"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11563"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子阿姨看向我这边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她是个对饭团有些执着的怪孩子。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识依然是那副老样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过话说回来……"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i455"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从今晚开始，屋里就会有一个男人跟三个女人啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然很热闹……但可能会有点不自在……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"比如洗澡的顺序啊，上厕所啊之类的……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来得稍微注意一下生活细节了。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]